   "body": "Verified in the code (dev-swift), as asked: the table of this issue is right, rule by rule, against `FilteredPostsCriteria.keeps` (`FilteredPostsCriteria.swift:44-53`): quoted at least N times (`quotedByCount >= effectiveMinimumQuoteCount`), a whitelisted author when « Inclure les pseudos whitelistés » is on (on by default), the account's own message, a message whose quotes cite the pseudo at any depth, a message whose content mentions the pseudo (text, case-insensitive). Two details that the text does not carry, to know:\n- The three rules about **you** (own messages, quotes of you, mentions) need an account's pseudo: with none (`pseudo` nil or blank) they are off, and only the quote count and the whitelist remain (`:46-47`).\n- The filter starts from the reader's « … » menu (`ReaderOverflowToolbar.swift:39`) **and** from the menu of the **favourites list** (`TopicListView.swift:224-229`, `model.source == .favorites`), not from every topic list; « Depuis un sujet (menu … › Filtrer les posts) » is true for the reader.\n\nPlacement, as the issue asked me to say: the (i) button is on the **« Minimum de citations » row**, not on the section header (a header button is styled as header text, and the bubble explains the number the picker sets). Text, from your draft: « Depuis un sujet (menu … › Filtrer les posts), n’affiche que les messages cités au moins N fois, les vôtres, ceux qui vous citent ou vous mentionnent, et ceux de votre liste blanche si l’option est activée. » / « « Minimum de citations » est ce N : plus il est grand, moins il reste de messages. » Label « À propos du filtre des posts ». PR #1064 (`Closes #1072`).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
